  "description": {
   "en": "Yamada Mima, 25 years old, a passionate artist working at a general store, with a hobby of supporting her favorite idols.\nHer ultimate favorite? Amagasu Akari, a member of the popular idol group SIX.\n\nOne evening, captivated by the beauty of the river’s shimmering surface, she impulsively posted on her long-abandoned social media. Moments later, a notification popped up—someone had liked her post.\n\nAnd that person was none other than… Amagasu Akari himself!?"
  },
